1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,175
Governance only matters if it can say no.

2
00:00:03,125 --> 00:00:08,637
Here a request to move funds hits the policy gate and is blocked — before the model is ever called.

3
00:00:08,637 --> 00:00:12,225
The model never sees it; it can't be talked around.

4
00:00:12,225 --> 00:00:14,812
And the block itself is audited.

